 a sapphire window and offers an optional cleaning brush to reduce deposits during ongoing monitoring.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":449},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":451,"_139":171,"_172":452,"_174":249,"_176":453,"_178":454,"_180":455,"_182":456,"_184":457,"_186":458,"_188":459},"95eccf83-22e5-4f4d-a03f-5509479d7661","2025040860985293.jpg",11246,"ecdac2d963d6479b136774a8172895d54061650f1cb8089d1404ff2a26710a79",190,78,"/igenu-preview/media/ecdac2d963d6479b136774a8.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.787Z",[460],{"_180":455,"_182":456,"_174":193,"_184":461},"/igenu-preview/media/c0547cb002a63d36b1ac374c.webp",{"_159":217,"_57":463,"_234":464,"_236":465,"_238":466,"_240":358,"_162":467,"_245":469},"ig30ol","IG30OL","IG30OL Oil-in-Water Sensor","Ultraviolet fluorescence detects oil in water for applications including petrochemical wastewater and oilfield reinjection monitoring. Optical filtering and a self-cleaning arrangement help manage measurement interference and deposits, while digital communication connects the probe to monitoring systems.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":468},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":470,"_139":171,"_172":471,"_174":175,"_176":472,"_178":473,"_180":474,"_182":474,"_184":475,"_186":476,"_188":477},"79d9f104-d914-4e36-bec2-d6d2b843fefd","2025041051182309.jpg",14215,"e3e2c21db606165f614650cf931244737a0e84793f3dd9ab8bd834db8aa5b8b3",540,"/igenu-preview/media/e3e2c21db606165f614650cf.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.888Z",[478,480],{"_180":191,"_182":191,"_174":193,"_184":479},"/igenu-preview/media/087409fcbd7eefe1aec06c53.webp",{"_180":474,"_182":474,"_174":193,"_184":481},"/igenu-preview/media/6d889354b11ab94fb489a773.webp",{"_159":218,"_57":483,"_234":484,"_236":485,"_238":486,"_240":358,"_162":487,"_245":489},"ig30ph01","IG30PH01","IG30PH01 Analog pH Electrode","An analog pH electrode for water and process monitoring, combining a gel-filled design with a double-junction reference arrangement. An integrated temperature sensor supports compensation, and the mounting bracket and flow cell provide options for installation at the measurement point.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":488},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":275,"_139":171,"_172":276,"_174":175,"_176":277,"_178":278,"_180":279,"_182":280,"_184":281,"_186":282,"_188":490},[491,492],{"_180":191,"_182":285,"_174":193,"_184":286},{"_180":279,"_182":280,"_174":193,"_184":288},{"_159":219,"_57":494,"_234":495,"_236":496,"_238":497,"_240":358,"_162":498,"_245":500},"ig30ptco","IG30PTCO","IG30PTCO Water Color Sensor","Optical absorption measures water color against the platinum-cobalt color scale. Automatic turbidity compensation and a cleaning brush support online monitoring, while stored calibration settings and digital communication simplify connection to water monitoring systems at the installation site.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":499},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":501,"_139":171,"_172":502,"_174":175,"_176":503,"_178":504,"_180":474,"_182":474,"_184":505,"_186":506,"_188":507},"e9c2938f-6236-4c7f-bf9d-752bcf98b444","2025040861512869.jpg",13520,"3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177b116d1a851d9d410ca383514dfbd7fdb3aa5270f","/igenu-preview/media/3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.805Z",[508,510],{"_180":191,"_182":191,"_174":193,"_184":509},"/igenu-preview/media/9fb61c06fe27bcc0e9cecfd6.webp",{"_180":474,"_182":474,"_174":193,"_184":511},"/igenu-preview/media/b63396be40013d2d55e983f5.webp",{"_159":220,"_57":513,"_234":514,"_236":515,"_238":516,"_240":358,"_162":517,"_245":519},"ig30rps","IG30RPS","IG30RPS Digital ORP Electrode","A digital ORP electrode for oxidation-reduction monitoring in water and industrial processes. Its platinum sensing element and double-junction reference are complemented by digital communication, sample or standard calibration, and a mounting bracket and flow cell for installation.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":518},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":275,"_139":171,"_172":276,"_174":175,"_176":277,"_178":278,"_180":279,"_182":280,"_184":281,"_186":282,"_188":520},[521,522],{"_180":191,"_182":285,"_174":193,"_184":286},{"_180":279,"_182":280,"_174":193,"_184":288},{"_159":221,"_57":524,"_234":525,"_236":526,"_238":527,"_240":358,"_162":528,"_245":530},"ig30rps01","IG30RPS01","IG30RPS01 Analog ORP Electrode","An analog ORP electrode for water treatment and process monitoring, using a platinum sensing element and double-junction reference. Sample and standard calibration options, together with a mounting bracket and flow cell, support installation and routine measurement.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":529},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":275,"_139":171,"_172":276,"_174":175,"_176":277,"_178":278,"_180":279,"_182":280,"_184":281,"_186":282,"_188":531},[532,533],{"_180":191,"_182":285,"_174":193,"_184":286},{"_180":279,"_182":280,"_174":193,"_184":288},{"_159":222,"_57":535,"_234":536,"_236":537,"_238":538,"_240":358,"_162":539,"_245":541},"ig3254cod","IG3254COD","IG3254COD UV COD and TOC Sensor","Ultraviolet absorption supports online COD and TOC measurement without reagent dosing. Turbidity compensation, calibration options and an available automatic cleaning system help adapt the digital probe to water monitoring, with results interpreted according to the selected calibration.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":540},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":470,"_139":171,"_172":471,"_174":175,"_176":472,"_178":473,"_180":474,"_182":474,"_184":475,"_186":476,"_188":542},[543,544],{"_180":191,"_182":191,"_174":193,"_184":479},{"_180":474,"_182":474,"_174":193,"_184":481},{"_159":223,"_57":546,"_234":547,"_236":548,"_238":549,"_240":358,"_162":550,"_245":552},"ig3500","IG3500","IG3500 Residual Chlorine Analyzer","DPD colorimetry measures residual chlorine in water for supply and process monitoring. The analyzer combines optical interference compensation, automatic cleaning and data storage, with relay outputs for control integration and an optional remote communication module for connected operation.",{"_57":242,"_243":-5,"_236":109,"_146":-5,"_143":551},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":553,"_139":171,"_172":554,"_174":249,"_176":555,"_178":556,"_180":557,"_182":558,"_184":559,"_186":560,"_188":561},"c50c4c9d-55bb-4423-8c3e-781ffff460bb","2025040937453857.jpg",161037,"8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d54c4a5ffd8e6ba0b79e7a6a527d4c31805dbb2c25",439,577,"/igenu-preview/media/8851b0c528aa8f3f11bac4d5.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.818Z",[562,565],{"_180":191,"_182":563,"_174":193,"_184":564},421,"/igenu-preview/media/a94dedbc4c305ed00e17532e.webp",{"_180":557,"_182":558,"_174":193,"_184":566},"/igenu-preview/media/addc2737c9f6397359f3a546.webp",{"_159":224,"_57":568,"_234":569,"_236":570,"_238":571,"_240":358,"_162":572,"_245":574},"ig4200","IG4200","IG4200 Online Total Solids Analyzer","Microwave transmission measures total solids concentration directly in water samples without prior separation or settling. Continuous readings and control-system connectivity support process monitoring in wastewater treatment, chemical production, pharmaceutical manufacturing and food processing applications.",{"_57":163,"_243":-5,"_236":113,"_146":-5,"_143":573},{"_103":113,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":575,"_139":171,"_172":576,"_174":175,"_176":577,"_178":578,"_180":579,"_182":580,"_184":581,"_186":582,"_188":583},"a7d0c5a5-4017-44bb-880a-fe921c7cae03","2025041053569693.png",47641,"4b53f5aab7936bf5768d9331003eaab972aa10e742396f2311725e7a132e48cb",490,278,"/igenu-preview/media/4b53f5aab7936bf5768d9331.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.927Z",[584,587],{"_180":191,"_182":585,"_174":193,"_184":586},182,"/igenu-preview/media/460947b2f394cc6a41c35af0.webp",{"_180":579,"_182":580,"_174":193,"_184":588},"/igenu-preview/media