el Transmitter","A submersible pressure-based transmitter measures liquid level using a silicon sensing element in a sealed stainless-steel housing. Selectable output options support monitoring of tanks, water systems and pumping installations, with wetted materials matched to the measured liquid.",{"_57":163,"_243":-5,"_236":113,"_146":-5,"_143":714},{"_103":113,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":716,"_139":171,"_172":717,"_174":249,"_176":718,"_178":719,"_180":720,"_182":721,"_184":722,"_186":723,"_188":724},"2c2a9461-2d1e-4d92-9b2f-bb3264ca2631","2025040851522761.jpg",83470,"4faf3f82eaab6ca730d4cb0baaed53b24302624c182eac3dae9bc76e518a7daa",399,397,"/igenu-preview/media/4faf3f82eaab6ca730d4cb0b.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.698Z",[725,728],{"_180":191,"_182":726,"_174":193,"_184":727},318,"/igenu-preview/media/c18242a2c8052f476dfdc70d.webp",{"_180":720,"_182":721,"_174":193,"_184":729},"/igenu-preview/media/7c5fdf13c62f45db05f4fbd2.webp","sourceSections",[732],{"_159":733,"_734":735,"_7":736,"_751":-5,"_752":753},"73c604ca-0ada-44f9-b773-e791bfae8e16","type","TEXT_IMAGE",{"_737":38,"_738":164,"_166":38,"_739":740,"_749":750},"body","heading","sourceNotes",[741],{"_103":742,"_743":150,"_166":744,"_745":746,"_747":748},"PROCESS WATER","pending","<p>Automatic analysis of waste water requires a great knowledge of effluents. For over 50 years now, IGENU has developed various systems of on-line sample preparation, such as paper filtration, tangential filtration or sample intake through sampling loops.</p>","sourceUrl","http://www.igenu.com/","capturedAt","2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z","imagePosition","right","media","mediaItems",[]]
